## Surfacing Stage 3 (luced-3d's docs/research/SURFACING-ALIAS-PLASTICITY.md
## §4.3, §6.3 to §6.5): curves cast onto faces (Project) and where faces
## meet (Intersect) as curves on faces; trimming faces by them (Keep,
## Discard, Divide) with the stages Untrim pops; Trim Convert and Shrink;
## Stitch and Unstitch with tolerant edges. The cutting, joining and
## writing are luce_cad.modeling's (trim, stitch, untrim, face_meets); this
## module fits the curves, keeps the stages and is what Luce calls
## (CadSurfacing).
##
